f $B$ as ${q}_{1},\\,{q}_{2},\\,{q}_{3}.$ \n\nSince $B$ is an orthonormal basis, we have that $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]$, where ${x}_{i}=x\\cdot {q}_{i}.$ Computing ${x}_{2},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} & =x\\cdot {q}_{2} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{6} \\\\ 3\\sqrt{6} \\\\ \\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{2}+3\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{2} \\\\  & =4\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}_{2}}{4}=\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{4}=\\sqrt{2}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-40402/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "39b12711-22c8-5cb7-bd61-e128734e7e6f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-40402"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-81105/selection/c9ec5d6cdf4e67c7f8bce68475bed400e56bf403f3d09b5928f78b6baa512eab" :answer/id #uuid "3d52d185-9025-52a7-8f19-1ae7e89f776e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "27" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81105/selection/e326a281f601aec64d5dcce4921033c5f93cbf7f8b0a7a5809a9962dfadde666" :answer/id #uuid "2d5ca909-6a46-540f-9712-a1665190b19f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81105/selection/04a84983d576665bfbfb320a6e35cbd365c3da4019dc70c3aa860fa57ab80c1f" :answer/id #uuid "0c6fe02e-fb01-5358-abb4-146f307d4eba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81105/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "ddd5c666-e267-57ca-aab1-54a5a2f8c64c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81105/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "59a29575-b2fb-52f4-8397-72